   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Weapons Adhering Secured Sites Project &#x2013; WASSP Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Weapons Adhering Secured Sites Project &#x2013; WASSP has been designed to make a direct and substantial contribution to the establishment of a fully sustainable munitions stockpile management system within the Ministry of Defence and Armed Forces of Bosnia and Hercegovina (MoD/AF BiH). Building upon the successful implementation of Phases I and II of the Ammunition Weapons and Explosives Master Plan (AWE MP) in Bosnia and Herzegovina and drawing on over 15 years of programmatic support from the Mi</narrative>
  </description>
